## 4. Technical Specifications and Service Levels

The Enterprise tier is specifically designed to meet the rigorous demands of large healthcare organizations, leveraging our robust infrastructure and compliance certifications.

### 4.1. System Availability and Reliability

| Metric | Standard | Professional | Enterprise |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Guaranteed Uptime SLA** | 99.9% | 99.95% | 99.99% |
| **Disaster Recovery RTO** | 8 hours | 4 hours | 1 hour |
| **Data Backup Frequency** | Daily | 12-hourly | Hourly |
| **Data Encryption** | In-transit (TLS 1.2+) | In-transit & At-rest (AES-256) | In-transit & At-rest (AES-256) |

### 4.2. Performance and Scalability

The platform is engineered for high throughput, supporting the rapid growth reflected in our FY 2024 total revenue of **AED 485,100,000** [1].

*   **API Latency:** Target P95 latency of < 150ms for core services.
*   **Data Processing:** Enterprise tier includes dedicated compute resources capable of processing up to 100 million records per hour.
*   **Security Certifications:** The platform maintains **SOC 2 Type II** (renewed August 2024), **HIPAA**, and **ISO 27001** certifications [1].

